SELECT $1 || replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(CAST(id AS text), '%', '%25'), ' ', '%20'), ':', '%3A'), '/', '%2F'), '"', '%22'), '<', '%3C'), '>', '%3E'), '#', '%23'), '?', '%3F'), '{', '%7B'), '}', '%7D'), '|', '%7C'), '\', '%5C'), '^', '%5E'), '`', '%60'), ',', '%2C'), '(', '%28'), ')', '%29') || $2 FROM (SELECT id FROM query_people) AS rtop_mapping